  "description": "Assists project managers in generating comprehensive project proposals by compiling and organizing key elements such as project objectives, scope, timeline, budget estimates, and staffing plans into a ready-to-edit proposal. Project managers can easily review and finalize the content, saving time and improving planning efficiency.",
